WEBVTT


00:01:34.360 --> 00:01:37.352
In the Buddhist year of 1974.
(1421 AD)


00:01:38.320 --> 00:01:42.518
During the reign of
King Rama II of Ayuthaya.


00:01:43.320 --> 00:01:48.394
The Ayuthaya royal court became
more powerful than Sukhothai.


00:01:49.280 --> 00:01:55.435
This was a very large expansion
for the royal court in the east.


00:01:55.480 --> 00:02:03.353
The Ayuthaya army lay seige to
the City of Angels for 7 months.


00:02:03.520 --> 00:02:08.310
1 year and 3 months later...


00:03:32.440 --> 00:03:35.273
You're on your own now,
little master.


00:03:45.440 --> 00:03:47.396
Now!!!


00:04:23.520 --> 00:04:25.511
Don't let that boy escape!


00:04:32.480 --> 00:04:39.318
'ONGBAK 2'


00:05:03.440 --> 00:05:05.351
Hey, stop!


00:05:23.480 --> 00:05:26.472
Go... Go...


00:06:40.440 --> 00:06:44.319
Get out... Get out...
quickly, now!


00:06:44.520 --> 00:06:46.431
Hey!


00:06:47.440 --> 00:06:49.317
Get down!


00:06:53.400 --> 00:06:55.391
Let me go...


00:07:05.520 --> 00:07:08.432
Let me go...


00:07:13.520 --> 00:07:16.273
This boy is next!


00:08:11.280 --> 00:08:13.350
Stop... stop.


00:08:17.400 --> 00:08:20.358
He will be the next fighter!


00:08:35.280 --> 00:08:37.430
I will give you one chance,
little boy,


00:08:37.520 --> 00:08:40.398
to save your life.


00:08:56.520 --> 00:08:59.273
Let me go!


00:09:20.400 --> 00:09:21.435
Silence!


00:09:21.520 --> 00:09:23.431
Let's begin!


00:11:22.480 --> 00:11:26.439
Your life is in your own hands,
young boy.


00:13:16.320 --> 00:13:18.515
'Teean... Wake up.'


00:13:19.520 --> 00:13:20.475
'Because of you!'


00:13:21.360 --> 00:13:22.475
'I want to be as skillful
as my father!'


00:13:22.520 --> 00:13:25.398
'When will you be back?'


00:14:14.400 --> 00:14:16.436
Is this the boy?


00:14:17.320 --> 00:14:19.311
Yes, father Cheang Kla.


00:14:21.400 --> 00:14:23.311
There is a light in his eyes,


00:14:23.440 --> 00:14:25.351
when he fights...


00:14:25.520 --> 00:14:28.273
that reminds me of someone.


00:14:52.520 --> 00:14:55.353
All the spirits will fear him.


00:14:56.520 --> 00:14:59.273
He has a powerful destiny!


00:15:04.360 --> 00:15:06.316
With his hands,


00:15:06.520 --> 00:15:08.476
as weapons...


00:15:09.320 --> 00:15:12.357
he will be the best of the best!


00:15:15.480 --> 00:15:17.436
I'm Cher Nung.


00:15:18.320 --> 00:15:21.392
I am the leader of the
Pha Beek Krut pirates.


00:15:21.440 --> 00:15:23.476
I am impressed with you.


00:15:23.480 --> 00:15:27.439
You fought with the crocodile
bravely and unyieldingly.


00:15:28.400 --> 00:15:33.474
If you want to learn more about
martial arts at my home,


00:15:33.520 --> 00:15:36.318
I will allow you to go there.


00:15:37.320 --> 00:15:42.394
Or, if you wish to go elsewhere,
I will not stop you.


00:16:17.520 --> 00:16:19.351
Shoot!


00:17:39.360 --> 00:17:41.351
Connect your mind and body.


00:17:41.440 --> 00:17:45.513
Become one with your weapons,
and use that power.


00:17:46.400 --> 00:17:49.278
These are the things that you
must practice at all times.


00:17:58.480 --> 00:18:02.268
Every weapon has
a different power.


00:18:02.520 --> 00:18:05.432
Long and short,


00:18:05.520 --> 00:18:08.353
weak and strong...
light and heavy.


00:18:20.480 --> 00:18:24.314
The weapon is power.


00:18:24.440 --> 00:18:28.319
Someone who can merge their
mind and body with it,


00:18:28.400 --> 00:18:30.470
will be a great and
powerful person.


00:18:30.520 --> 00:18:35.355
The world and everyone in it
will yield to their power.


00:18:53.480 --> 00:18:57.314
I'm Cher Nung, the leader
of the Pha Peek Krut pirates.


00:18:57.480 --> 00:19:00.358
I have given you a new life.


00:19:02.400 --> 00:19:04.311
From now on,


00:19:04.320 --> 00:19:07.278
you will always remember...


00:19:07.440 --> 00:19:10.512
that you are a
Pha Peek Krut pirate!


00:22:43.520 --> 00:22:48.514
In the test of dexterity
and cleverness,


00:22:49.480 --> 00:22:51.357
Teean passes.


00:22:52.360 --> 00:22:57.309
The next test is about fighting.


00:28:57.520 --> 00:28:59.351
That's the way to do it,


00:28:59.440 --> 00:29:01.431
just like your father!


00:29:11.320 --> 00:29:13.276
This place,


00:29:13.400 --> 00:29:16.278
is to prove the power
of your mind.


00:29:21.360 --> 00:29:22.509
Help me...


00:29:24.520 --> 00:29:26.511
Let me go!


00:29:29.400 --> 00:29:31.436
Help me.


00:29:36.400 --> 00:29:38.311
Help me!


00:29:48.360 --> 00:29:50.271
Help me!


00:29:51.520 --> 00:29:53.476
Don't be afraid of me.


00:29:54.280 --> 00:29:55.429
You don't need to be scared.


00:29:55.520 --> 00:29:57.476
I will set you free.


00:29:57.480 --> 00:29:59.391
Come with me.


00:30:00.520 --> 00:30:03.318
I will help you.


00:30:03.360 --> 00:30:05.396
Don't be scared...


00:30:05.480 --> 00:30:07.471
don't be scared.


00:31:23.320 --> 00:31:26.517
Your life is in your
own hands now.


00:31:52.480 --> 00:31:56.359
Killing and compassion,


00:31:57.320 --> 00:32:02.314
are the last things that
a leader must learn.


00:32:08.440 --> 00:32:11.477
Brothers, sons and grandsons.


00:32:12.440 --> 00:32:14.271
Today,


00:32:14.480 --> 00:32:17.313
the spirit god of Fah Mansong


00:32:17.520 --> 00:32:20.512
has sent a black ivory tusk


00:32:21.440 --> 00:32:23.396
from the king of elephants to us,


00:32:23.520 --> 00:32:27.433
as a sign of good fortune.


00:32:28.320 --> 00:32:30.390
This special mystical object


00:32:30.480 --> 00:32:33.392
will bring prosperity


00:32:34.320 --> 00:32:37.392
to our community.


00:32:44.400 --> 00:32:46.311
And now,


00:32:46.440 --> 00:32:48.396
I, Cher Nung,


00:32:48.520 --> 00:32:50.431
announce that,


00:32:50.480 --> 00:32:53.358
for now and after,


00:32:53.440 --> 00:32:55.431
in future times...


00:32:55.480 --> 00:32:57.391
I give Teean,


00:32:58.320 --> 00:33:01.312
the position of second
in command, after me!


00:36:02.520 --> 00:36:04.431
Why doesn't dad teach me
how to fight?


00:36:04.520 --> 00:36:06.431
I don't want to learn dancing.


00:36:06.480 --> 00:36:08.391
I don't want to go
away from here.


00:36:08.560 --> 00:36:10.437
I want to be with dad.


00:36:10.480 --> 00:36:12.436
You need to leave,
don't you know?


00:36:12.560 --> 00:36:14.357
You will be a great person,


00:36:14.400 --> 00:36:16.391
you must believe me.


00:36:42.480 --> 00:36:44.357
Show some respect, my son.


00:36:44.560 --> 00:36:46.516
You have all had a long journey.


00:36:46.520 --> 00:36:49.273
Let's go into the house.


00:36:55.440 --> 00:36:57.396
It has been more than 3 months


00:36:57.480 --> 00:37:02.270
since Ayuthaya started
to expand their power,


00:37:02.520 --> 00:37:04.511
and the situation in Ayuthaya town


00:37:04.520 --> 00:37:07.432
is still not under control.


00:37:07.560 --> 00:37:09.516
The heir to the throne


00:37:10.280 --> 00:37:12.271
is deeply anxious.


00:37:12.520 --> 00:37:15.318
Orders have been given to me


00:37:15.400 --> 00:37:20.315
to suppress rebellion in
the conquered towns.


00:37:20.480 --> 00:37:24.268
Why does Ayuthaya rush
to expand its power?


00:37:24.440 --> 00:37:29.468
The city administrator, Chao Praya Seena,
does not seek to oppose the King's heir.


00:37:32.320 --> 00:37:37.394
This all seems like
Chao Praya Seena's idea.


00:37:39.400 --> 00:37:41.470
His power is dangerous...


00:37:42.360 --> 00:37:45.397
but a person who abuses power
is more dangerous!


00:37:45.480 --> 00:37:47.471
This country will be aflame.


00:37:48.320 --> 00:37:51.392
People everywhere will rebel.


00:37:52.440 --> 00:37:55.273
This situation cannot be trusted.


00:37:56.520 --> 00:38:01.355
From now on, only you and
the master are to be trusted.


00:38:02.360 --> 00:38:04.430
It is under these circumstances
that I will allow,


00:38:04.520 --> 00:38:06.431
Teean to be left here.


00:38:06.560 --> 00:38:08.516
Brother Bua...


00:38:09.520 --> 00:38:12.512
I'm so scared, I have
lost all spirit.


00:38:14.520 --> 00:38:20.356
I now leave him
under your protection.


00:38:23.480 --> 00:38:26.358
I will try my best.


00:38:26.480 --> 00:38:29.313
Both of you need to be careful.


00:38:29.520 --> 00:38:32.318
Heung Sri. Klong Kri...


00:38:32.480 --> 00:38:34.391
Take us out of here now.


00:38:35.520 --> 00:38:37.317
Yes sir!


00:39:11.320 --> 00:39:12.355
My name is Pim.


00:39:12.520 --> 00:39:14.431
My parents are both dead.


00:39:14.520 --> 00:39:18.354
Master Bua has looked after me
since I was very young.


00:39:19.400 --> 00:39:21.356
And you?


00:39:21.440 --> 00:39:23.431
My father's name is Singh Adachoo.


00:39:23.520 --> 00:39:27.433
He is one of the four top
military leaders of Ayuthaya.


00:39:27.520 --> 00:39:32.310
I told my dad I wanted to learn everything
about weapons and fighting.


00:39:33.440 --> 00:39:35.431
I wanted to be skillful,
like my father.


00:39:35.520 --> 00:39:40.514
But instead, he sent me out
to learn about dance.


00:39:40.560 --> 00:39:43.438
How can I ever hope to be
a good fighter?


00:40:00.520 --> 00:40:02.511
Why is the sound of my flute so dry?


00:40:28.480 --> 00:40:30.436
Hey, stinky!


00:40:40.440 --> 00:40:45.309
Scratch... scratch...
Oh... and itchy balls too!


00:40:46.400 --> 00:40:48.436
Yeah, I've got the same...
I've got the same.


00:40:48.520 --> 00:40:50.397
Up you go.


00:40:54.480 --> 00:40:56.436
And gone, too.


00:40:59.440 --> 00:41:02.512
Spin... spin... spin...


00:41:07.400 --> 00:41:10.472
Hey... He disappeared!


00:41:10.560 --> 00:41:12.516
I'll try the same.


00:41:14.480 --> 00:41:16.436
Disappear too!


00:41:30.560 --> 00:41:32.391
Teean.


00:41:32.520 --> 00:41:35.318
Do you think a person who
learns about weapons


00:41:35.400 --> 00:41:38.392
will lead this country
to happiness?


00:41:39.520 --> 00:41:42.273
I only think that...


00:41:42.400 --> 00:41:45.358
learning about weapons
to protect myself,


00:41:45.480 --> 00:41:49.359
to help good people,
and kill bad people...


00:41:49.440 --> 00:41:52.318
can help this country be happy.


00:41:52.440 --> 00:41:53.475
Good.


00:41:54.280 --> 00:41:55.508
What you say sounds good.


00:41:56.520 --> 00:41:58.317
Teean.


00:41:58.480 --> 00:42:02.359
There are a lot of weapons
in this world.


00:42:03.400 --> 00:42:07.439
Which one will you use to
help your country and its people?


00:42:12.400 --> 00:42:15.312
You don't need to answer me now.


00:42:50.520 --> 00:42:52.397
Take this.


00:43:17.560 --> 00:43:21.348
Let's get down to business!


00:43:34.520 --> 00:43:37.353
Let go!...


00:43:37.400 --> 00:43:39.356
Mother!


00:43:40.320 --> 00:43:42.276
Son!... Son!


00:43:43.360 --> 00:43:45.510
Let him go!


00:43:47.320 --> 00:43:49.311
C'mon!


00:44:02.320 --> 00:44:05.392
Mother... Mother...


00:44:35.480 --> 00:44:37.471
Who did that!?


00:44:39.360 --> 00:44:40.395
It was you!


00:44:42.520 --> 00:44:44.351
Or you!


00:44:57.520 --> 00:45:00.353
Do you really dare?


00:45:01.400 --> 00:45:05.439
Drink... drink... drink...


00:48:55.360 --> 00:48:56.509
Let me live!


00:48:56.520 --> 00:48:58.317
I don't want to die.


00:48:58.360 --> 00:49:03.275
I have money, gold, slaves...
You can take them if you want.


00:49:03.360 --> 00:49:05.271
Good.


00:49:05.360 --> 00:49:07.396
I will give you one chance.


00:49:11.520 --> 00:49:14.353
The same one that you gave me.


00:49:25.480 --> 00:49:27.516
Take him to the crocodile pit!


00:49:28.320 --> 00:49:30.311
Noooo!


00:49:31.400 --> 00:49:33.391
I don't want to die!


00:49:36.520 --> 00:49:40.354
Help me... help me...


00:49:42.360 --> 00:49:44.430
Set all the slaves free.


00:50:01.520 --> 00:50:04.353
Thank you so much.


00:50:57.440 --> 00:50:58.429
Teean...


00:50:58.520 --> 00:51:00.511
how long will you be gone?


00:51:02.280 --> 00:51:04.350
Do you really need to go, Teean?


00:51:04.400 --> 00:51:07.517
If you go, who I will play with?
I don't want you to go, Teean.


00:51:10.360 --> 00:51:13.477
Don't go, Teean...


00:51:16.320 --> 00:51:18.390
Don't be scared.


00:51:20.520 --> 00:51:22.476
I will be back soon.


00:51:23.360 --> 00:51:24.429
Let's hurry little master.


00:51:24.480 --> 00:51:26.391
Otherwise we'll be late!


00:51:30.480 --> 00:51:32.516
I'm leaving now.


00:51:41.440 --> 00:51:43.431
Teean!


00:52:26.320 --> 00:52:28.311
Why do we have to hurry like this?


00:52:34.440 --> 00:52:35.475
Hey, Koon Kri!


00:52:35.520 --> 00:52:38.432
Where are you taking
the little master?


00:52:40.520 --> 00:52:42.397
Don't you dare try
to betray the leader!


00:52:42.480 --> 00:52:44.391
Betrayer!


00:53:02.520 --> 00:53:05.318
Little master, get away!


00:53:07.440 --> 00:53:08.509
You!


00:53:37.480 --> 00:53:39.471
Release me...


00:53:40.320 --> 00:53:42.436
Release me now,
and I will tell you!


00:53:43.520 --> 00:53:45.431
I want to see my father!


00:53:46.320 --> 00:53:48.470
Release me!!


00:54:22.320 --> 00:54:24.470
I don't wanna go... Dad!


00:54:38.440 --> 00:54:40.476
Dad... Dad!


00:54:48.400 --> 00:54:50.436
Dad...


00:54:51.280 --> 00:54:53.430
Help me.


00:55:24.360 --> 00:55:27.397
You will die like your master.


00:55:29.440 --> 00:55:32.273
Ratchasena, you tyrant.


00:55:32.360 --> 00:55:33.475
Kill him!


00:55:59.520 --> 00:56:02.318
Dad!


00:56:04.520 --> 00:56:06.476
Catch him!


00:56:14.520 --> 00:56:17.318
You're on your own now,
little master.


00:56:27.520 --> 00:56:29.397
Now!!!


00:56:52.520 --> 00:56:55.432
Don't let the boy escape!


00:57:27.440 --> 00:57:29.431
Are you sure?


00:57:33.480 --> 00:57:37.314
The day I met you at
the crocodile pit,


00:57:38.440 --> 00:57:41.398
It made me think
of someone else.


00:57:42.440 --> 00:57:44.317
That someone was me...


00:57:44.440 --> 00:57:46.510
when I was younger.


00:57:48.400 --> 00:57:50.311
That night...


00:57:50.440 --> 00:57:53.273
The light in your eyes
was strong.


00:57:54.320 --> 00:57:57.357
A light like fire blown
by the wind.


00:57:58.440 --> 00:58:00.396
Today,


00:58:00.480 --> 00:58:04.359
it still shines in your eyes.


00:58:12.520 --> 00:58:14.351
This is why, today,


00:58:14.400 --> 00:58:18.439
I gave you the position
of leader of the pirates.


00:58:19.400 --> 00:58:22.392
But if you have something
else on your mind,


00:58:23.360 --> 00:58:26.318
you had better go
and finish it first.


00:58:28.440 --> 00:58:32.399
The Pha Peek Krut pirates
and I...


00:58:35.480 --> 00:58:38.438
will wait for the day
that you return.


01:00:48.280 --> 01:00:50.316
Dear governers,


01:00:51.320 --> 01:00:54.312
ministers, statesmen,


01:00:55.440 --> 01:00:58.432
and astrologers:


01:00:59.360 --> 01:01:01.476
This is an auspicious time,


01:01:02.400 --> 01:01:05.312
according to the heavens.


01:01:06.360 --> 01:01:11.275
I, the first king of Kruttha Thep,


01:01:11.360 --> 01:01:13.476
will open this ceremony


01:01:14.360 --> 01:01:16.510
to offer a sacrifice to
the Sukhothai Angel,


01:01:17.280 --> 01:01:19.475
and remain the figurehead


01:01:20.360 --> 01:01:24.512
of the Kruttha Thep
royal family forever!


01:08:09.480 --> 01:08:12.358
This is for my mother!


01:08:26.520 --> 01:08:28.351
Soldiers!


01:08:28.480 --> 01:08:30.471
And this is for my father!


01:08:30.520 --> 01:08:32.351
Aooya Singhadachoo!!


01:08:37.360 --> 01:08:38.429
Soldiers!


01:10:09.280 --> 01:10:10.474
Father!


01:10:10.520 --> 01:10:12.351
I have returned!


01:23:53.400 --> 01:23:56.437
Your father's sword will not
taste my blood that easily.


01:24:00.520 --> 01:24:04.354
Do not waste your time.


01:24:05.320 --> 01:24:08.312
I know someone who
waits to kill you.


01:24:08.400 --> 01:24:10.391
Just wait and see!


01:24:16.480 --> 01:24:19.472
Now all of the Singhadachoo family
are dead.


01:24:21.320 --> 01:24:24.357
And only the son
still stands alive,


01:24:25.320 --> 01:24:27.311
in front of me.


01:24:29.480 --> 01:24:36.352
You should hurry and
finish your task quickly.


01:24:54.400 --> 01:24:56.277
Father?


01:25:00.320 --> 01:25:02.470
A king who does not
go back on his word,


01:25:03.440 --> 01:25:05.476
must keep his promises.


01:25:08.320 --> 01:25:11.437
You must keep your promise,
and let my family live.


01:25:14.280 --> 01:25:16.475
Whether I live or die!


01:25:19.520 --> 01:25:23.274
The man in black who
stands before you now,


01:25:23.360 --> 01:25:25.430
is the one who killed your father.


01:25:26.360 --> 01:25:28.316
Kill him.


01:25:30.440 --> 01:25:32.396
Kill him now!


01:25:32.440 --> 01:25:34.431
If you still have the energy.


01:26:07.480 --> 01:26:08.515
You traitor!


01:26:09.280 --> 01:26:11.316
You deserve to die!


01:26:17.480 --> 01:26:19.471
If I had known it was you,


01:26:20.320 --> 01:26:22.390
I would've killed you long ago!


01:26:30.480 --> 01:26:32.277
I'm the one...


01:26:32.520 --> 01:26:35.398
The one who killed your father!


01:27:03.520 --> 01:27:08.310
Take your father's life back.


01:27:08.480 --> 01:27:10.391
My son.


01:27:54.320 --> 01:27:56.436
Cher Nung!!!


01:28:02.480 --> 01:28:04.357
Take him away!


01:28:07.480 --> 01:28:10.392
But don't let him die too quickly.


01:28:12.320 --> 01:28:14.436
Punish him and make him suffer.


01:28:15.440 --> 01:28:18.273
Make an example of him,


01:28:19.320 --> 01:28:22.437
and let him die slowly!


01:28:27.520 --> 01:28:29.476
Teean came to this point,


01:28:30.360 --> 01:28:32.396
because of his past deeds.


01:28:32.480 --> 01:28:34.357
If enough of you


01:28:34.440 --> 01:28:36.431
put your hearts together
to help him...


01:28:36.440 --> 01:28:38.431
and share in the belief


01:28:39.320 --> 01:28:41.436
that he should cheat this death.


01:28:41.520 --> 01:28:44.353
Then his mind can be
released from torment,


01:28:44.520 --> 01:28:47.273
and he can rest in peace.
